  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Monster-_Dew_Valley_Pup.jpg\" title=\"Dew Valley Pup\"><img alt=\"Dew Valley Pup\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"219\" src=\"/images/Monster-_Dew_Valley_Pup.jpg\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Monster-_Dew_Valley_Pup.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Dew Valley Pup</div></div></div>\n<p>Wolf Pups are small Wolves.\n</p><p><b>Race:</b> <a href=\"/wiki/Category/Wolves\" title=\"Category:Wolves\">Wolf</a>\n</p><p><b>Class:</b> Melee \n</p>\n<a name=\"Basic_Types\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Basic Types</span></h2>\n<ul><li> Dew Valley Wolf Pup. You will first encounter these in <a href=\"/wiki/Dew_Valley\" title=\"Dew Valley\">Dew Valley</a> Forest.\n</li><li> Warg Pup. You find these on the upper levels of <a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a>.\n</li></ul>\n<a name=\"Uniques\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Uniques</span></h2>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
